WEBVTT

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.140
It's so hot!

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.830
Well, it <i>is</i> summer now!

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:08.660
Miyuki! Akane!

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.270
Look what I found-kuru!

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.460
Where'd ya get that, Candy?

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:15.680
It was on the ground-kuru.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:16.650
Someone must have lost it.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:17.170
Yeah.

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:19.170
We better take it to a police station.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.150
Yep!

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:21.750
Say cheese-kuru!

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:28.500
Miyuki...? Akane...?

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.990
Where'd you go-kuru?

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:32.370
What's wrong, Candy?

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:33.950
We're right here.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.580
Huh? Where-kuru?!

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:36.840
Here!

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.120
I-It's a ghost-kuru!

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:45.090
Somebody save me-kuru!

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:48.740
What's up with Candy?

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.630
Ghosts? What was that all about?{TLC: "I don't see any ghosts" is kind of awkward because 1) the main plot 2) Candy assumed there were ghosts because she didn't see anyone, implying she's talking about ghosts you wouldn't expect to be able to see, anyway}

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:53.910
What?

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:55.930
Look! Look at the mirror!

00:00:58.950 --> 00:00:59.990
Huh?

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:12.550
It's not showing us?

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:13.650
Why not?

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:15.870
We're invisible...

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:21.700
Don't you get it? <i>We've really become invisible!</i>{TLC: not a change towards more accuracy.  It's just a different workaround for the repetition problem. (original was "We've really turned invisible!")}

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:28.450
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:30.280
Smile Precure!

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:31.190
Let's go!

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:32.720
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:33.850
All together!

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:35.460
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:37.660
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:40.330
Smile Precure!

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:45.170
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:50.600
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:55.810
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:56.540 --> 00:02:01.750
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:06.690
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:06.650
So bright!

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:11.860
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:18.300
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:18.800
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:19.970
Let's go!

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:22.670
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:25.610
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:30.410
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:30.980
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.650
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:33.780
Everybody!

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.450
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:37.990
Fly to the future!

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:41.490
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:43.660
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:45.960
Smile Precure!

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:52.410
It's gone! Where'd it go-da wasa?!

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:55.080
You lost something again, Majorina?

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:58.090
My newest creation, the Invisiblator! It's gone-da wasa!

00:02:58.300 --> 00:02:59.490
What the heck's that?

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:02.160
It's a camera that turns people invisible-da wasa!

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.910
Oh, you mean the camera!

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:04.930
You know where it is-da wasa?!

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:06.080
I threw it out.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:08.300
Why on earth would you do that-da wasa?!

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:17.530
Good morning!

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:18.810
Good morning.

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:20.950
What are we gonna do, Akane-chan?!

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:23.630
It's all right, they can still hear us!

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:25.650
They're sure to notice us!

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.920
What? Miyuki-san and Akane-san disappeared on you?

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:32.340
I could hear their voices, and then something lifted me off the ground-kuru!

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:34.540
Seems a bit crazy, doesn't it?

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:36.880
I can't believe they'd just somehow up and vanish like that...

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:38.360
But they did-kuru!

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:40.050
Yeah, we did!

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:41.560
We really did!

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:42.720
Huh?!

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:45.030
I could have sworn I just heard their voices...

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:46.440
I don't see them...

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:47.970
Are we just hearing things?

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:49.160
How very odd.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.840
Oh man, they really can't see us...

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:53.550
Come on, Yayoi-chan!

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.510
There's someone there!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.480
I'm here too!

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:06.190
Here.

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.860
It's a ghost!

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:12.550
We're not ghosts!

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:16.770
It's just us, Nao!

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:18.500
Are we really that scary?

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:22.640
It <i>is</i> them-kuru!

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:25.660
I can smell Miyuki and Akane-kuru!

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.110
I'm Miyuki!

00:04:34.110 --> 00:04:35.740
And I'm Akane!

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:38.890
Together we make the invisible duo!{TLC: original had "men" not "duo".  The Japanese isn't literally "duo", but 1) it avoids having our schoolgirls call themselves men (the Japanese isn't gender- or age- specific) 2) they're talking like a pair of comedians or action heroes or something, anyway}

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:41.490
Amazing...

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:45.270
Looks like our clothes and bags turned invisible too...

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:47.660
What a truly incredible phenomenon.

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:50.430
Yeah, I bet they're just loving it!{maybe a bit loose and snarky but i like loose and snarky V: feel free to slap me back into line if you wish <3}{TLC: "I like loose and snarky" - that's what *Mag* said. If you don't like Mag's version: "This isn't science class!" (literally "It's not the time for admiration", but that sucks)}

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.460
How'd you two end up like that, anyway?!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.010
Ah, hey, you don't think...

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:59.140
...it could have been the flash from that weird camera?

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:02.730
If we had that camera, we might be able to return you to normal!

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:03.910
Hey, good thinkin'!

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:05.370
Candy, where's the camera?

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:06.410
{Kuru?}

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.370
I... I left it behind-kuru...

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:10.720
I'll go find it-kuru!

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.760
We're counting on ya, Candy!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.640
Ah well, until she gets back...

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:17.520
we'll just have to live with it.

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.570
We'll assist as best we can.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:20.430
Yeah!

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.510
Good morning!

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:23.970
Good morning, class.

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.370
All right, let's take attendance.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:33.940
Why are you two dressed like that?

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.840
We caught a bit of a cold...

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:37.850
So we're wearing warm clothes.{TLC: took out the "to sweat it out". Providing an explanation makes the next line follow on less naturally (it wasn't in the Japanese, anyway)}

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:40.150
But why exactly...?

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:43.740
Th-They don't want anyone to see them when they're looking so ill, Ma'am!

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:46.890
They have very delicate skin, see...

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:50.790
Ma'am, shouldn't you get on with taking attendance?

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:52.030
R-Right...

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:56.230
Candy, hurry and find that camera!

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:57.730
Pass it here!

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:58.700
Over here!

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:04.840
I wanna play basketball too!

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:06.580
We can't while we're like this!

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:12.050
Gotcha!

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:19.620
All right!

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:22.060
I can't take this anymore!

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:23.440
You need to go to the toilet too?

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:24.730
No, I need to play!

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:28.900
Yayoi-san!

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:32.970
Take the shot, Yayoi-chan!

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:47.350
All right!{TLC: the spelling was "Alright" in previous scripts}

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:51.710
You can't do that, Akane!

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:52.890
I know, but...

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.590
I knew it!

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:59.060
Akane, I think you'll find that using invisible players is against the rules!{TLC: replaced with a more literal line because of the comedic irony. Original was "Akane, being invisible doesn't give you the right to breach the team count!"}

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:02.580
Sorry, I just kinda...

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:09.440
My bad. It won't happen again.

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:11.630
It wasn't me!

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.470
Akane!

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:15.920
I'm over here~!

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:20.220
You little...!

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:23.220
What do you think Midorikawa-san's doing over there?

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:24.490
Don't ask.

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:27.420
Alright. Hand in your homework, please.

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:30.840
I got all mine done, no sweat!

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:31.790
Me too!

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:35.420
Where's your homework, you two?

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:37.800
Huh? It's right here.

00:07:38.110 --> 00:07:39.640
No it's not.

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:42.500
But see, it's right...

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:45.950
I suppose, because their clothing and bags turned invisible,

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:50.150
the notebooks and textbooks inside did as well.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.210
Ah, so that's why...

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:54.080
You two forgot your homework, didn't you?

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:57.650
No, ma'am! Can'tcha see these notebooks?!

00:07:58.050 --> 00:07:59.390
No, I cannot!

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:01.120
Oh, God, why?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.520
Ah, it's so hot!

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:10.000
I'm meltin' here...

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.040
Ah, hey Nao!

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:16.510
Come draw with us!

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.040
I'm scared{, Mommy}!{LET'S SHIPPING}

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.620
What if someone were to see you?

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:21.950
I'm beyond carin'!

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:23.210
It's so hot!

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:25.550
Hey, leave this to me!{TLC: nothing particularly funny about the original, but it's easy to overuse "I know" in subs, so I think it's best to save it for when it's really needed}

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:33.290
And... done!

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:38.510
How cute!

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:41.700
I look like somethin' out a comic, here!

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:42.630
You think people will notice?

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:43.960
No, of course they won't!

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:45.060
They're gonna notice!

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:46.200
Notice what?

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:48.770
N-N-Nothing, Ma'am!

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:53.170
What a strong breeze...

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:56.330
Umm, Miss Hoshizora? Your... head?

00:08:56.980 --> 00:09:01.220
I-I couldn't paint the hair; it was too difficult! I mean, uh...

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.640
It's our new magic trick!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:05.620
Of course it is, I mean to say, what else could it be?

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:08.460
Y-Yes, quite... Of course.

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:13.310
It's magic!

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:15.130
This really isn't going to work...

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.940
Finally, lunch break.

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:20.310
Well, we made it through the morning, at least.

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:21.840
I'm starving...

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.470
Lunch ti—

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:30.150
That was yummy!

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:32.140
Akane-chan...

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:34.350
Oh come on, is <i>one</i> really gonna hurt?

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:36.750
That looked funny! Do it again!

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.110
A'ight!

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:40.720
It's magic! Just a bit of magic!

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:43.860
I fear we won't be able to keep this up much longer...

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:47.000
Candy, hurry up and find that camera!

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:50.030
I can't find it at all-kuru...

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:52.640
It's a <i>camera-da wasa!</i> A <i>camera,</i> I say!

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:58.470
Hrm... Would this be your missing camera, by any chance?

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:02.050
That's it-da wasa! My Invisiblator!

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:06.060
Now, let's see. Your name was Majo Rina, was it not?

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:07.220
Can I have your date of birth?

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:09.320
Huh? Once upon a time-da wasa!

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:13.660
"Once upon a time..." All right... and your place of residence?

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.820
The Bad End Kingdom-da wasa.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:19.360
"Bad End..." I can't say I've ever heard of that.

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:21.050
Where is it, exactly?

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:24.660
Africa? Europe?

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:34.580
Huh? Majo Rina-san? Where did you go?

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:35.910
She disappeared-kuru.

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:39.850
Majo Rina! <i>Majo Rina!</i>

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:43.250
With this, those Precure are toast-da wasa!

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:45.960
Oh no-kuru...

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:51.690
Sunny!

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:58.620
Candy!

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:04.720
See you tomorrow!

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:07.270
Well, we got through school somehow!

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:10.060
We better split up to look for Candy and the camera!

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:25.010
What on earth is going on?

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:25.980
Don't tell me...

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:27.480
This isn't funny, Akane!

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:29.670
It's not her-kuru!

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:30.680
Candy!

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:31.380
She's flying?!

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:34.180
I didn't do anythin'!

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:35.750
The one who's really behind this...

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.120
Is Majorina!

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:40.760
That's right-da wasa!

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:44.230
Hrm? How can you see me, exactly-da wasa?

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:47.810
Because we're invisible too!

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.670
You used my Invisiblator, didn't you-da wasa?!

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:53.010
I'm afraid you won't be able to stop me-da wasa!

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:56.840
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:59.810
a Bad End-da wasa!

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:04.120
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness-da wasa!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:16.230
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, King Pierrot-da wasa!

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:25.000
How can you be so cruel?!

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:26.210
You're gonna pay for this!

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:28.210
Let's transform, everyone!

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:30.650
You're facin' the wrong way!

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:32.080
Over here!

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:33.340
Where's here, though?!

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:34.860
We can't see you!

00:12:34.860 --> 00:12:36.180
This is posing quite the problem...

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:39.180
I don't suppose you want to return to normal, do you-da wasa?

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:40.050
Of course we do!

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:41.950
Then say cheese!

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:50.960
What's she thinkin'?

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:52.000
Miyuki-chan!

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.200
Akane!

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:55.100
We can see you both again!

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.370
Really?!

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:58.400
We're back to normal!

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:03.510
But the real question is, can you see <i>me-da wasa?</i>

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:08.210
Oh man! Now we're back to normal, we can't see her anymore!

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:10.480
I'm afraid you cottoned on a bit too late!{TLC: it seems like the Ed isn't familiar with the phrase "cotton on". I know it, but I'm from a Commonwealth background, same as Mag}

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:13.950
Where did she go?!

00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:16.720
There!

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:26.200
Oh man... I can't believe I fell for my own trick!{this is an actual playground prank in japan, and the thing here is that akane did this to nao earlier. i think a translation like this that makes reference to that is probably the best way of dodging the cultural dissonance?}{TLC: FTR, I did this plenty of times as a kid in Australia.  I changed it from "knee-push" to "trick".  Viewers can see on the screen what the prank actually involves, so there's no need for any awkward TLing}

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:27.960
Avenge me!{standard samurai I'VE FAILED type line V:}

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:32.310
How could you do that to Akane?!

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:35.670
Where are you?! Show yourself!

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:37.740
Well, I can do my best!{GET IT BECAUSE SHE'S INVISIBLE}

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:40.310
Cootchie-cootchie-coo!

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:41.420
Nao-chan?!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:43.450
Don't tell me Majorina's there, is she?!

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:45.180
Don't pick on Nao-chan!

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:51.010
She's gone?

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:52.610
I guess she ran off...

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.380
Yayoi-chan!

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:58.190
Nao-chan!

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:00.070
Miyuki-chan!

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:02.560
How cowardly!

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:04.840
She's makin' laughing stocks out of us...

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:08.510
Now, to get this show on the road-da wasa!

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:11.510
Come on out, Akanbe!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:16.850
Huh...?

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:27.730
Akanbe...!

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:22.390
It's a jack-in-the-box!

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:25.400
Not very big though, is it?

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:27.730
Doesn't seem too strong, either.

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:30.650
Anyway, we'd better transform!

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:31.360
Okay!

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:36.320
Ready?

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:39.750
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:40.730
Go!

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.160
Go, go!

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:44.980
Let's go!

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:50.060
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:53.090
Cure Happy!

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.240
Dazzling sun!

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:59.090
Hot-blooded power!

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.740
Cure Sunny!

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:06.890
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:10.100
Cure Peace!

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:15.260
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:18.310
Cure March!

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:24.240
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:26.990
Cure Beauty!

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:31.550
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:41.590
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:46.200
A'ight! Let's take that thing!

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:49.410
Oh, I think not-da wasa!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:53.770
The Akanbe vanished?!

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:57.740
So, what's your next move-da wasa?

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:03.020
Well, if the jack-in-the-box is invisible, it won't be able to scare us!

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:03.680
Good point!

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:07.490
I take that back!

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:08.490
Peace!

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:14.160
Happy! Beauty!

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:17.630
That's the way!

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:20.970
We can't tell where it is anymore...

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:22.440
I know! Candy!

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:25.100
Can ya use your nose to smell out where it is?

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:28.260
Leave it to me-kuru!

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:31.310
None of that, please-da wasa!

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:40.990
The pork and soybean sweets strike once again!

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:44.560
Oh man! Candy ain't gonna be able to smell anything now!

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:47.760
Sunny!

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:51.600
If we could only ascertain its location, we wouldn't be having such trouble.

00:17:51.600 --> 00:17:53.370
What should we do?!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.570
Maybe we could listen for its footsteps?

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:57.130
Yeah, sound!

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:04.150
Precure...

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:08.380
March Shoot!

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:12.850
I don't think it did anything...

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:14.620
Akanbe!

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:18.620
Don't forget I'm here too-da wasa!

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:21.460
I can make as much noise as I want-da wasa!

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:27.870
Those Precure can't fight what they can't see-da wasa!

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:30.640
Akanbe!

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:31.700
It's coming for us again!

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:34.400
I have an idea.

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:37.220
Precure...

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.920
Beauty...

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:43.420
Blizzard!

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:48.320
Akanbe!

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:51.560
Not even close-da wasa!

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:53.780
Beauty, what're you doin'?!

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:54.960
That was quite intentional.

00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:59.310
Look...

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:02.840
The Beauty Blizzard is making it snow...

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:05.400
Look, everyone! It's over there!

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:10.340
The snow's piling up on the Akanbe!

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:12.040
Now we can see it!

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:13.210
Nice one, Beauty!

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:15.340
We gotcha now!

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:20.370
Akanbe!

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:25.830
My Invisiblator!

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:31.700
Now, combine your powers-kuru!

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:38.510
Let's go!

00:19:46.650 --> 00:19:47.920
Precure...

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:53.800
Rainbow...

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:55.310
Healing!

00:19:57.850 --> 00:20:00.730
Akanbe...

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:10.540
Curse you, Precure! I'll get you for this-da wasa!

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:14.020
Looks like Majorina left... not that we could tell...

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:16.440
Yeah, we couldn't see her leave, but...

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:19.000
We did it!

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:24.250
That fairy <i>does</i> hold some kind of secret, doesn't she...

00:20:24.510 --> 00:20:30.200
Oh, I'm dying to know your secret, little fairy!

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:34.870
I'm glad you two are back to normal, anyway!

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:35.430
Yeah!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.390
I'm hungry after all that running around-kuru.

00:20:38.390 --> 00:20:39.640
Okay!

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.020
Let's Go: Cherry!

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:48.240
That was yummy-kuru!

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:51.940
Man, though, that camera really put us through the works...

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:53.960
We'd better be more careful.

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:55.880
Miyuki! Akane!

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:56.650
Hrm?

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:58.940
Look what I found-kuru!{from here...}

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:01.760
Where'd ya get that, Candy?

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.200
It was on the ground.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:04.210
Someone must have lost it.

00:21:04.210 --> 00:21:04.560
Yeah.

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:06.970
We better take it to a police station.

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:08.000
Yep!

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:09.540
Say cheese-kuru!

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:17.070
It's gone! Where'd it go-da wasa?!{as does this one}

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.730
You've lost something else already?

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:23.600
I've managed to lose my spare Invisiblator too-da wasa!

00:21:23.600 --> 00:21:24.800
Oh, that!

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.280
Do you know where it is-da wasa?!

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:27.510
I threw it out.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:29.880
Why on earth would you do that-da wasa?!{which isn't exactly the same as it's equivalent earlier, but reuses a lot of the same lines}

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:32.350
Miyuki...? Akane...?{this exchange is also a direct retread of it's earlier equivalent, so again, make sure any changes happen to both <3}

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:33.780
Where'd you go-kuru?

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:35.030
What's wrong, Candy?

00:21:35.030 --> 00:21:36.460
We're right here.

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:38.200
Huh? Where?!

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:39.660
Here!

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:43.790
I-It's a ghost-kuru!

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:46.900
Somebody save me-kuru!

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:50.500
Don't tell me...

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:52.780
Miyuki-chan, Akane...

00:21:52.780 --> 00:21:54.180
Umm...

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:56.710
I'm afraid you've turned invisible again...

00:21:58.340 --> 00:22:01.820
No way!

00:23:39.410 --> 00:23:40.840
It'll soon be time for the Tanabata festival,

00:23:40.840 --> 00:23:42.840
when we wish upon a star!

00:23:42.860 --> 00:23:45.510
I hope I can make delicious okonomiyaki...

00:23:45.510 --> 00:23:47.480
I hope I can draw beautiful pictures...

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:49.550
I hope our family can go on vacation together!

00:23:49.550 --> 00:23:51.880
I hope I will always do the right thing...

00:23:51.880 --> 00:23:57.470
I want to be able to play with you all forever-kuru!

00:23:57.470 --> 00:23:58.830
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:04.460
Find your ultra happy smile!
